    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the throttle and unravel a corporate conspiracy in neon noir! You are the city\u2019s ghost\u2014an elite motorcyclist in a mask. Leaving a trail of wreckage and hidden clues, you must discover why ruthless megacorps are waging war on your streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- High-octane Bike Combat: Seamlessly blend high-speed riding with deadly takedowns in one fluid system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Interactive Detective Work: Hunt for evidence through interrogations, surveillance, and hacked communications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cyberpunk Noir Atmosphere: Rain-slicked asphalt, glowing neon signs, and an \u201980s-inspired synth soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Time-Loop Mechanics: Relive critical moments, tweak your choices, and perfect every mission run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why You\u2019ll Love It: Ghost-Line fuses heart-pounding action with deep detective storytelling in a vibrant, rain-soaked metropolis where every second could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
